   "data": {
    "text": "NOVA: TILT CV\n\n1. Hold the Nova the way you\n   like, then press R3:\n   PLAY mode. That pose is\n   the centre.\n2. Tip it left/right: filter\n3. Tip it away/toward you:\n   pitch\n\nPress R3 twice to set a new\ncentre. Tilt is off outside\nPLAY mode."
   }
